msgstr "Ai-WB2 series supports mode 2/3; default is 3"

#: ../../source/docs/command-set/AT_Basic_Commands.rst:253
#: 859d3af3419849bf83e50f2f619b5b14
msgid ""
"注意：Ai-WB2 系列的 GPIO 唤醒配置时 param1 指定的引脚是没有映射的，也就是芯片实际的引脚，且仅支持 IO7 引脚(IO7 是 "
"RX 引脚，所以串口唤醒我们一般设置 IO7 低电平环境即可，也就是 AT+SLEEP=2,2,7,0)"
msgstr ""
"Note: For Ai-WB2 series GPIO wake-up configuration, the pin specified by "
"param1 is not mapped; it refers to the actual chip pin. Only IO7 is "
"supported (IO7 is the RX pin, so for UART wake-up, set IO7 to a low-level "
"environment, e.g., AT+SLEEP=2,2,7,0)"

